  "name": "Yrdsl",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "yrdsl is a Model Context Protocol server for running a digital yard sale.\nA sale is a single page with photos, prices, short descriptions, and seller\ncontact information. Buyers message the\nseller directly; there's no cart, no checkout, no payments.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 MCP server**, `yrdsl`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install yrdsl@claude-community` from `KuvopLLC/yrdsl` (`plugins/yrdsl`).\n\nPublish a digital yard sale from a chat with Claude. Works against the hosted service at yrdsl.app or a self-hosted fork of the `yrdsl-self-hosted` template running on GitHub Pages, Vercel, Netlify, or Cloudflare Pages.",
